{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-royal-park","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"royal-park-reportage-properties-masdar-city","about":"Royal Park by Reportage Properties is a modern residential complex consisting of 6 mid-rise buildings. The buildings have a modern architectural design and are located in the unique Masdar City community in the UAE, built according to green building principles.The complex features 1, 2 and 4 bedroom apartments, as well as three-storey townhouses and duplex penthouses.Each Royal Park apartment and penthouse is decorated with stylish and functional finishes using high quality materials. All properties are equipped with balconies, master bedrooms with bathrooms and dressing rooms. Townhouses are planned with an elevator installation location. Included in the price are kitchen cabinets and countertops, built-ins with plumbing fixtures, bathrooms and central air conditioning.Royal Park residents have access to a variety of amenities such as an outdoor pool, fitness center and children's playground. The complex is located in a developed employment area, including a park, an international school, an artificial intelligence university, a shopping center and public transport links. Important landmarks such as Masdar City Central Park, Mohamed Bin Zayed University for Artificial Intelligence and Masdar Solar Photovoltaic Farm are within a series connection from the complex.","price":804195,"title":"Royal Park","bitrix":{"id":839,"pf_id":"are.2.13308","source":null,"project_id":"Royal Park","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Royal Park Residence","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Reportage Properties","project_location":"Masdar City"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/607/images/2023/12/12/340x252/lmlyfSz6q0goH4e4h8B6psKIw9C2rhEODsonCwIv.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/607